        <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto">
            <p>Welcome to SarkarTravels! Founded with a deep love for the Himalayas, our mission is to showcase the breathtaking beauty, diverse cultures, and rich biodiversity of Northeast India.</p>
            
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mt-10 mb-4">Our Story</h3>
            <p>What started as a small initiative to guide travelers through the winding roads of Darjeeling and Sikkim has blossomed into a full-service travel company. We believe that travel should be more than just sightseeing—it should be an immersive experience that leaves a positive impact on both the traveler and the destination.</p>
            
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mt-10 mb-4">Our Commitment to Sustainability</h3>
            <p>We are deeply committed to eco-conscious travel. By partnering with local homestays, promoting community-first tourism, and working to offset our carbon footprint, we ensure that the fragile ecosystems of the Himalayas remain pristine for generations to come.</p>
            
